## High-Priority UX Enhancements

### H1. Unify loading states with shared branding components
**Files affected:** All 8 programs pages (11 inline spinners found)

Replace every inline `Loader2`/`RefreshCw` with `animate-spin` + "Loading..." text with the shared `PageLoader` from `@/components/branding/loading`. Replace inline `animate-pulse` card skeletons with `CardSkeleton` / `TableSkeleton` / `StatCardSkeleton`. Replace inline stat-card pulse with `DashboardStatsLoader`.

**Pattern:** `import { PageLoader, CardSkeleton, StatCardSkeleton } from "@/components/branding";`

### H2. Unify empty states with shared EmptyState component
**Files affected:** All 8 programs pages (28 inline empty states found in the broader audit)

Replace every hand-rolled empty state (icon + heading + description + button) with `EmptyState` or its pre-built variants (`NoDataEmpty`, `NoResultsEmpty`) from `@/components/branding/empty-state`.

### H3. Unify error banners to a consistent red style
**Files affected:** Detail page and curriculum detail page (use yellow), others use red

All error banners should use red: `bg-red-50 border-red-200 text-red-600` with an `AlertCircle` icon and Retry button. The yellow banners on the detail page and curriculum detail page should be changed to red for consistency.

### H4. Add toast feedback to all mutations
**Files affected:** New page (no toast), edit page (no toast), curriculum list page (no toast), detail page (only error toast, no success toast)

Add `toast.success()` on successful create/update/publish/delete and `toast.error()` on failure. Import `toast` from `@/lib/toast`.

### H5. Replace `confirm()` with `ConfirmModal` on edit page
**File:** `apps/web/src/app/admin/programs/[programId]/edit/page.tsx`

Replace the native `confirm()` dialog (line 112) with the `ConfirmModal` component from `@/components/admin`, matching the pattern used on the programs list page. The modal should show the program name and consequence text, with a loading state on the delete button.

### H6. Fix the new program page
**File:** `apps/web/src/app/admin/programs/new/page.tsx`

- Replace `apiRequest("/api/programs", ...)` with `programsApi.create()` for consistency
- Add `toast.success("Program created")` on success
- Add auto-slug generation from name (matching the edit page's `generateSlug` pattern)
- Remove the `status` dropdown — backend forces `DRAFT` on create, so showing a Published option is misleading
- Add a "Creating..." spinner on the submit button using `ButtonLoader`
