### H7. Fix the edit page header inconsistency
**File:** `apps/web/src/app/admin/programs/[programId]/edit/page.tsx`

Change `DashboardHeader` import to `WorkspaceHeader` from `@/components/admin`, with breadcrumbs `[{ label: "Programs", href: "/admin/programs" }, { label: program.name, href: ... }, { label: "Edit" }]` and a status badge. This matches every other page in the programs directory.

### H8. Add publish confirmation + loading state on detail page
**File:** `apps/web/src/app/admin/programs/[programId]/page.tsx`

The "Publish" button immediately calls the API with no confirmation and no loading state. Add a `ConfirmModal` for publish (explaining that publishing makes the program visible to learners) and disable the button with a spinner while the API call is in progress.

### H9. Wire up the exams page "Create Assessment" button
**File:** `apps/web/src/app/admin/programs/[programId]/exams/page.tsx`

(Resolved as part of C3 rewrite.) The button should link to `/admin/assessments/new?programId={programId}`.

### H10. Remove dead code and fix console.log statements
**Files affected:** Multiple programs pages

- Remove `cetTargetProgram` state (set but never read) in `page.tsx`
- Remove `isSaving` dead state in curriculum list page and curriculum detail page
- Remove `console.log` statements in `[programId]/page.tsx` (lines ~315-317, ~433-436)
- Remove unused `result` variables from `createFromTemplate` and `generateCetExams` calls
- Remove non-functional "Settings" buttons (TODO comments) in curriculum list/detail pages OR wire them to actual functionality

