**File:** `apps/web/src/app/admin/programs/[programId]/curriculum/page.tsx`

The info card says "You can also drag to reorder curriculums" but there is no drag-and-drop. Either implement drag-and-drop using the existing `DraggableList` component, or remove the misleading text. **Recommendation:** Remove the text for now (drag-and-drop reordering requires a backend reordering endpoint that doesn't exist yet).

