## Medium-Priority UX Enhancements

### M1. Add `programsApi.getById(id)` to API client
**File:** `apps/web/src/lib/api/client.ts`

Add `getById: (id: string, token?: string) => apiFetch(\`/programs/${id}\`, { token })`. Add the corresponding backend route `GET /programs/:id` in the controller and `getProgramById(id)` in the service. This fixes the `.list().find()` inefficiency in C4.

### M2. Fix CET exam topic slug mismatches
**File:** `apps/api/src/modules/programs/templates.ts`

Many `topicSlugs` in CET exam templates don't match actual topic slugs defined in the grade subjects. Unmatched slugs are silently dropped, producing exams with zero or partial topics. Fix all mismatched slugs to match the actual topic slugs defined in the template's grade subjects.

### M3. Add unsaved-changes warning on edit form
**File:** `apps/web/src/app/admin/programs/[programId]/edit/page.tsx`

Track dirty state by comparing `formData` against the original `program` data. Show a browser `beforeunload` warning if there are unsaved changes, and/or disable the Cancel button conditionally with a confirmation.

### M4. Add program type dropdown on edit page (instead of free text)
**File:** `apps/web/src/app/admin/programs/[programId]/edit/page.tsx`

Replace the free-text `programType` input with a `<select>` populated from `EDUCATIONAL_STAGES` (matching the new page's pattern). Display with human-friendly labels.

### M5. Fix slug auto-generation overwriting manual edits
**File:** `apps/web/src/app/admin/programs/[programId]/edit/page.tsx`

Add a `slugEdited` boolean state. When the user manually types in the slug field, set `slugEdited = true`. Only auto-generate slug from name if `slugEdited` is false. This preserves manually-edited slugs when the user later fixes a typo in the name.

### M6. Improve "Generate CET Exams" UX
**File:** `apps/web/src/app/admin/programs/page.tsx`

Currently, "Generate CET Mock Exams" silently targets `programs[0]` (the first program in the unfiltered list) with no user confirmation. Add a program picker modal or a dropdown to select which program to generate exams for, with a confirmation step explaining what will be created.

### M7. Remove fake progress simulation
**File:** `apps/web/src/app/admin/programs/page.tsx`

The `runProgressSimulation` function uses `setTimeout` to fake progress (45s for populate, 15s for CET). The actual API may complete faster or slower. Replace with a simple indeterminate loading state (spinner + "Populating curriculum...") and show the real result when the API resolves.

