## Additional Component-Level Fixes (from shared-components audit)

### A1. CurriculumSubjectManager uses native `confirm()` and hand-rolled DOM toast
**File:** `apps/web/src/components/admin/curriculum-subject-manager.tsx`

This component (used by the curriculum detail page) uses native `confirm()` for delete confirmation and a hand-rolled `showToast` helper that directly manipulates `document.body` (creating/removing DOM elements). Both are inconsistent with the app's `ConfirmModal` and `sonner` toast systems.

**Fix:** Replace `confirm()` with `ConfirmModal` (imported from `@/components/admin`). Replace `showToast` DOM manipulation with `toast` from `@/lib/toast`. Remove the `showToast` helper function entirely.

### A2. CurriculumSubjectManager drag-and-drop & move-item are false-success stubs
**File:** `apps/web/src/components/admin/curriculum-subject-manager.tsx`

`handleDrop` (line ~409) shows a success toast and calls `refreshItems()` but never sends a reorder API call — nothing actually reorders. `moveItem` (line ~374) is similarly a stub with a comment "Note: This would require API support." Users get false "success" feedback.

**Fix:** Remove the false success toasts. Either (a) disable drag-and-drop and move-item UI until backend reordering endpoints exist, or (b) show an informational toast "Reordering is not yet available" when the user attempts it. **Recommendation:** Remove drag-and-drop reordering UI for now; keep the visual tree but make rows non-draggable. Remove the move-item modal button.

### A3. EntitySearchPicker "Load more" appends duplicate results
**File:** `apps/web/src/components/admin/entity-search-picker.tsx`

`hasMore = filtered.length >= 10` but the API returns all results and filtering is client-side. "Load more" re-fetches the full list and appends it, causing visible duplicates.

**Fix:** Remove the fake pagination. Since all results are fetched and filtered client-side, show all results at once (or increase the initial visible count). Remove the "Load more" button and `hasMore` logic.

### A4. `generateSlug` duplicated across 4 form files
**Files:** `apps/web/src/components/admin/forms/subject-form.tsx`, `module-form.tsx`, `topic-form.tsx`, `lesson-form.tsx`, and `apps/web/src/app/admin/programs/[programId]/edit/page.tsx`, `apps/web/src/app/admin/programs/new/page.tsx`

The same `generateSlug` function is copy-pasted 6+ times. Should be a shared utility.

**Fix:** Create `apps/web/src/lib/utils/slug.ts` exporting `generateSlug(name: string): string`. Import it in all form files and both program pages. Delete the inline copies.

### A5. CurriculumJourney dead import and type cast
**File:** `apps/web/src/components/admin/curriculum-journey.tsx`

`ChevronRight` is imported but never used (dead import). Subject count uses `(curriculum as any).items?.length || 0` — a type cast that returns 0 if `items` isn't passed, even when `_count.items` is available.

**Fix:** Remove `ChevronRight` import. Fix subject count to use `_count?.items || _count?.subjects || 0` instead of the `any` cast on `items`.

